flowchart LR
  Query[Customer search] --> Normalize[Normalize words and equipment aliases]
  Normalize --> Intent[Unambiguous equipment constraint]
  Intent --> Filter[Visible products + all remaining terms + category/sport]
  Filter --> Rank[Title/brand/model relevance + stable title/id]
  Rank --> Page[Database count and pagination]
  Page --> Cards[Storefront Featured results]
